.DS_Store

# Claude Code's local plugin/config cache — a separate git repo that ended up
# nested here and got picked up as a dangling submodule reference (no
# .gitmodules ever pointed anywhere). Unrelated to this project; not meant to
# be published with it. Run `git rm --cached ECC` once to also untrack the
# stale index entry — this pattern alone won't do that for an already-tracked
# path.
ECC/
